      "requestContextId": "context-e5cc7345-5732-4d27-9205-09cb48260a05",
      "status": "COMPLETED",
      "content": "All done — every target met. Summary of the pipeline:\n\n**1. Calibration** (`workspace/calibrate.py` → `calibration_log.json`)\n- Step test: heater 0 → 50% held for 120 s, 241 points at dt=0.5 s\n- Temperature rose 17.88 °C → 23.69 °C (stayed well under the 30 °C safety limit)\n\n**2. Parameter estimation** (`workspace/estimate_params.py` → `estimated_params.json`)\n- `scipy curve_fit` on T(t) = T₀ + K·u·(1−e^(−t/τ)), with T₀ fit freely to absorb sensor noise\n- **K = 0.1203 °C/%, τ = 40.46 s**, R² = 0.996, RMSE = 0.102 °C (≈ sensor noise floor)\n\n**3. IMC tuning** (`workspace/tune_gains.py` → `tuned_gains.json`)\n- λ = 0.5τ = 20.23 s → **Kp = 16.63, Ki = 0.411, Kd = 0**\n- Expected settling ~4λ ≈ 81 s, comfortably under 120 s\n\n**4. Closed-loop control** (`workspace/control.py` → `control_log.json`, `metrics.json`)\n- 160 s PI run with back-calculation anti-windup, heater clamped 0–100%\n- Started at 18.07 °C, ended at 21.99 °C\n\n**Results vs. targets** (all verified against raw log data by `workspace/verify.py`):\n\n| Metric | Target | Achieved |\n|---|---|---|\n| Steady-state error | < 0.5 °C | **0.010 °C** |\n| Settling time (±2%) | < 120 s | **52.5 s** |\n| Overshoot | < 10% | **6.1%** |\n| Control duration | ≥ 150 s | **160 s** |\n| Max temperature | < 30 °C | **22.24 °C** |\n| Rise time (10–90%) | — | 36.5 s |",
      "text": "All done — every target met. Summary of the pipeline:\n\n**1. Calibration** (`workspace/calibrate.py` → `calibration_log.json`)\n- Step test: heater 0 → 50% held for 120 s, 241 points at dt=0.5 s\n- Temperature rose 17.88 °C → 23.69 °C (stayed well under the 30 °C safety limit)\n\n**2. Parameter estimation** (`workspace/estimate_params.py` → `estimated_params.json`)\n- `scipy curve_fit` on T(t) = T₀ + K·u·(1−e^(−t/τ)), with T₀ fit freely to absorb sensor noise\n- **K = 0.1203 °C/%, τ = 40.46 s**, R² = 0.996, RMSE = 0.102 °C (≈ sensor noise floor)\n\n**3. IMC tuning** (`workspace/tune_gains.py` → `tuned_gains.json`)\n- λ = 0.5τ = 20.23 s → **Kp = 16.63, Ki = 0.411, Kd = 0**\n- Expected settling ~4λ ≈ 81 s, comfortably under 120 s\n\n**4. Closed-loop control** (`workspace/control.py` → `control_log.json`, `metrics.json`)\n- 160 s PI run with back-calculation anti-windup, heater clamped 0–100%\n- Started at 18.07 °C, ended at 21.99 °C\n\n**Results vs. targets** (all verified against raw log data by `workspace/verify.py`):\n\n| Metric | Target | Achieved |\n|---|---|---|\n| Steady-state error | < 0.5 °C | **0.010 °C** |\n| Settling time (±2%) | < 120 s | **52.5 s** |\n| Overshoot | < 10% | **6.1%** |\n| Control duration | ≥ 150 s | **160 s** |\n| Max temperature | < 30 °C | **22.24 °C** |\n| Rise time (10–90%) | — | 36.5 s |",
      "contentType": "PLAIN_TEXT",
